{"id":"wb-7-1556","name":"大宋新修会圣宫铭碑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"会圣宫碑","text":"大宋新修会圣宫铭碑，通称会圣宫碑，是位于中国河南省洛阳市偃师区山化镇寺沟村凤凰山的一通北宋碑刻。碑立于宋仁宗景祐元年（1034年），由石中立撰文，李孝章书丹并篆额，记述会圣宫的营建经过及奉安帝王御容的礼仪，现仍立于原址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A3%E5%AE%AB%E7%A2%91","revisionId":95379663,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95379663","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1132d14297a9ae73ec25f010.jpg","title":"20240815_Stele_of_the_Construction_of_Huisheng_Palace_in_Song_Dynasty_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240815_Stele_of_the_Construction_of_Huisheng_Palace_in_Song_Dynasty_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/20240815_Stele_of_the_Construction_of_Huisheng_Palace_in_Song_Dynasty_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​大宋新修会圣宫铭碑","width":320,"height":480}}